  "prefLabel": "Ins 3602.02 Applicability and Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 3602.02 Applicability and Scope. This part shall be applicable to all long-term care insurance policies and to any policy or certificate that will be marketed and sold under the New Hampshire long-term care partnership program.\n\nSource. #9654, eff 2-16-10; ss by #12472, eff 2-16-18",
